{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "rashomon-stories",
  "chunk_id": "rashomon-stories-chunk-0952",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00952",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "我扭头看了看他。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I turned my head and looked at him.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00952",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "他目光没看任何人，像平时一样讥讽的笑着说：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "His eyes were not looking at anyone, and he said with his usual mocking smile:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00952",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "“不知道是谁，污蔑那只河童是青蛙——",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I do not know who it was, but someone slandered that kappa by calling him a frog—",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00952",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "你应该知道这个吧，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "You must know this, I suppose,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00952",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "在这个国家，被称作青蛙就等于被骂作畜生。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "In this country, being called a frog is the same as being cursed as a beast.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00952",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "——他整天怀疑：我是青蛙吗？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "—All day long he kept wondering: am I a frog?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00952",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "不是青蛙吧？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Surely I am not a frog, am I?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00952",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "抑郁而终了。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "And so he died in depression.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
